  "90 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 26 min of vigorous work a week. Some muscle soreness is expected; joint pain is not. Still sore after 48 hours? Repeat sessions before moving up.": "90 min de la Zona 2 programada i uns 26 min de treball vigorós a la setmana. S'espera una mica de dolor muscular; dolor articular no ho és. Encara fa mal després de 48 hores? Repetiu les sessions abans de pujar.",
