  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "En nivells més fàcils, mou lentament fins que aprenguis el moviment.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Almenys 120 min de la Zona 2 programada i uns 51 min de cardio dur a la setmana; blocs vigorosos controlats dimarts, dijous i dissabte.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, manté el ritme ràpid i per sota de l'esforç total. At Active, treballa dur. At Well trained, feu un esforç total.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, agafa una manuella a cada mà o posa una banda al voltant de la cintura amb l'àncora davant teu. La banda t'ha de tirar cap endavant, com un trineu.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, empeny cap enrere amb les mans. At higher levels, tira-te enrere amb els isquiotibials.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Al final de l'últim interval, tingueu en compte la vostra freqüència cardíaca màxima. Camineu suaument durant 60 segons i torneu a tenir en compte la vostra freqüència cardíaca. Introduïu la gota (pic menys lectura de 60 segons).",
