  "Pick how the demonstrations look. Every style shows the same movement.": "Trieu com es veuen les demostracions. Cada estil mostra el mateix moviment.",
  "Pick one or two moves from “Indoor interval moves”.": "Trieu un o dos moviments de \"Moviments a intervals interiors\".",
