  "Walk backward along a clear hallway, taking short steps and turning before the wall.": "Camineu enrere per un passadís clar, fent passos curts i girant davant la paret.",
  "Walk backward for 2 min along a clear stretch of hallway or living room. Turn around when you reach the wall.": "Camineu cap enrere durant 2 minuts per un tram clar de passadís o sala d'estar. Gireu-vos quan arribeu a la paret.",
